  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advanced capacity-building course on sustainable municipal 
wastewater treatment plant operations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The planned, advanced capacity-building course will focus on providing the in-depth knowledge of (especially small community) wastewater treatment plant (WWTP) operation &amp; maintenance for a wide range of audiences (e.g. WWTP operators, engineers, and chemists).Detailed workings, functioning and limitations of different unit processes (i.e. physical, chemical, and biological treatment) will be shared and discussed with an expert audience.The focus of the course will be on using the WWTP operation &amp; maintenance know-how.</narrative>
  </description>
